    },
    {
      "step_index": 25,
      "step_id_ifixit": 354080,
      "full_description": "- Insert two flat-head screwdrivers through the top of the fan opening in the fan assembly.\n- Position the head of each screwdriver opposite each other underneath the fan hub.\n- Use the screwdrivers to pry the fan off the shaft.\n- Remove the fan.",
